{"name": "Trotter", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With no past and no sense of origin, you find yourself standing in a dark bunker somewhere unknown. Explore abandoned ruins and forgotten landscapes left empty by their original occupants, battle enigmatic foes, and unravel the deep mystery of your existence in this action RPG adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ACTION THAT MAKES AN IMPACT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We want to deliver a dynamic, impactful experience where the gear and weapons you bring, combined with your skill, determine the outcome in every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"272\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/d8c1ad6cbe040d3055f36d84c0c806c2.poster.avif?t=1776884391\" width=\"478\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/d8c1ad6cbe040d3055f36d84c0c806c2.webm?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/d8c1ad6cbe040d3055f36d84c0c806c2.mp4?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration is a core mechanic. Traverse a rich open world filled with vast outdoors, bunkers, buildings, and caves. Examine maps and follow clues to riches and hidden rewards for an authentic open-world experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"274\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/f01cf8457f348444fc68cda3e70b39f5.poster.avif?t=1776884391\" width=\"478\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/f01cf8457f348444fc68cda3e70b39f5.webm?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/f01cf8457f348444fc68cda3e70b39f5.mp4?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><br/><strong>LOOT &amp; CRAFT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost everything in the world is lootable. Break down unusable items into raw components for crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"268\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/38912681972334554dac8f63273672f8.poster.avif?t=1776884391\" width=\"478\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/38912681972334554dac8f63273672f8.webm?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/extras/38912681972334554dac8f63273672f8.mp4?t=1776884391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "With no past and no sense of origin, you find yourself standing in a dark bunker somewhere unknown. Explore abandoned ruins and forgotten landscapes left empty by their original occupants, battle enigmatic foes, and unravel the deep mystery of your existence in this action RPG adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007380/de98a1e4a841a8cf65143d97e391a3b44e967bc4/header.jpg?t=1776884391", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "RPG", "Action RPG", "Looter Shooter", "Top-Down Shooter", "Top-Down"], "developers": "Sysiac Games", "publishers": "Sysiac Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": 